FEDERATION\", \"Vavilova Ulitsa, 19, MOSCOW, MOSCOW, 117312, Russia\", \"19 rue Vavilova, 117997 Moscou, Fédération de Russie\", \"ul. Vavilova, dom 19, MOSCOW, MOSCOW, 117997, Russia\"], \"bikCode\": [\"044525225\"], \"country\": [\"cn\", \"ru\", \"in\"], \"innCode\": [\"7707083893\"], \"kppCode\": [\"773601001\"], \"leiCode\": [\"549300WE6TAF5EEWQS81\"], \"ricCode\": [\"SBER.MM\"], \"summary\": [\"Financial Services Company\", \"Bank\"], \"website\": [\"http://www.sberbank.com/\", \"http://www.sberbank.ru/\"], \"ogrnCode\": [\"0000000000000\", \"1037739479601\", \"1027402058595\", \"1031900523302\", \"1027301568887\", \"1027700207743\", \"1027700132195\", \"1027739651830\"], \"swiftBic\": [\"SABRRUMM\", \"SABRINDD\"], \"createdAt\": [\"2002-07-01\"], \"legalForm\": [\"Публичные акционерные общества\", \"Financial Institution\", \"PJSC\"], \"programId\": [\"GB-RUS-INV\", \"GB-RUS\", \"US-SSI\", \"SECO-UKRAINE\", \"UA-SA1644\", \"US-UKRRUS-REL\", \"EU-UKR\"], \"publisher\": [\"Pandora Papers - Alemán, Cordero, Galindo & Lee (Alcogal)\"], \"sourceUrl\": [\"https://offshoreleaks.icij.org/nodes/240104727\", \"https://offshoreleaks.icij.org/nodes/240104731\", \"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/disqualified-officers/corporate/ALfy1P3m68ImSzGIIy8kMomHVVM\", \"https://search-uk-sanctions-list.service.gov.uk/designations/RUS0256/Entity\", \"https://sanctionssearch.ofac.treas.gov/Details.aspx?id=17018\", \"https://gels-avoirs.dgtresor.gouv.fr/Gels/RegistreDetail?idRegistre=4894\", \"https://permid.org/1-5000036115\"], \"taxNumber\": [\"7707083893\"], \"weakAlias\": [\"Sberbank India\", \"Sberbank Mumbai\"], \"modifiedAt\": [\"2025-07-03\"], \"description\": [\"legal entity\"], \"mainCountry\": [\"ru\"], \"jurisdiction\": [\"ru\"], \"previousName\": [\"Open Joint Stock Company Sberbank of Russia\", \"Sberbank Rossii OAO\", \"Otkrytoe Aktsionernoe Obshchestvo Sberbank Rossii\", \"Joint Stock Commercial Savings Bank of the Russian Federation\", \"Sberb