онерне товариство «Акціонерний банк «Росія»\", \"BANK ROSSIYA\", \"BANK \'ROSSIYA\'\", \"Bank Rossiya\", \"АО \\\"АБ \\\"РОССИЯ\\\"\", \"открытое акционерное общество \\\"Акционерный банк \\\"Россия\\\"\", \"открытое акционерное общество «Акционерный банк «Россия»\", \"Aktsionerny Bank Russian Federation\"], \"alias\": [\"Open Joint Stock Company Rosiya Joint-Stock Bank\", \"Banka Rusko\", \"Банка „Русия“\", \"AB ROSSIYA, OAO\", \"Otkrytoe Aktsionernoe Obshchestvo Aktsionerny Bank Rossiya\", \"OTKRYTOE AKTSIONERNOE OBSHCHESTVO AKTSIONERNY BANK ROSSIYA\", \"Banca Rossiya\", \"Banco Rossiya\", \"Bank Rossija\", \"Russia Bank\", \"Банк «Россия»\", \"Акционерное общество \'Акционерный Банк \'РОССИЯ\'\'\", \"Bank of Russia\", \"AB Rossiya, OAO\", \"Bank Rossiya\", \"Joint-Stock Bank Rossiya\", \"Aktsionerne tovarystvo \\\"Aktsionernyi bank \\\"Rosiia\\\"\", \"Банк “Россия\\\"\", \"Aktsionerny Bank Russian Federation\"], \"email\": [\"bank@abr.ru\"], \"notes\": [\"7831000122 (fiscalcode-National Fiscal Code) (INN)\", \"Bank Rossiya is the personal bank of Senior Officials of the Russian Federation.\", \"Fondée le 27/06/1990\\nSite internet: Abr.ru\\nPersonnes associées: Yuriy KOVALCHUK (actionnaire principal)\\nCourriel: bank@abr.ru\\nNuméro de licence: 328\\nINN: 7831000122\\nOGRN: 1027800000084\", \"License number: 328\", \"Founded on 27.6.1990;  Associated individuals: Yuriy KOVALCHUK (largest shareholder)\\nLicense number: 328\", \"(also BANK ROSSIYA)\", \"Дата присвоения государственного регистрационного номера: 2002-08-05\", \"Website: Abr.ru\", \"Personal bank for senior officials of the Russian Federation Registration ID: 1027800000084 (Russia) Government Gazette Number: 09804148 (Russia) Tax ID No.: 7831000122 (Russia) Email: bank@abr.ru Website: www.abr.ru SWIFT/BIC: ROSYRU2P SWIFT/BIC: ROSYRU2PXXX Legal Entity Identifier (LEI): 534006WDUE2J9S01D70\", \"The prohibition on correspondent banking relationships and processing payments was imposed on 15/12/2023. The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.\", \"INN: 7831000122\", \"Associated individuals: Yuriy Kovalchuk (largest shareholder)\", \"Email: bank@abr.ru\", \"Bank Rossiya is the personal bank of Senior Officials of the Russian Federation. In this capacity, Bank Rossiya supports and benefits from Russian decision-makers responsible for the annexation of Crimea or the destabilisation of Eastern Ukraine. Associated with Yuriy Valentinovich Kovalchuk, largest shareholder of Bank Rossiya. Bank Rossiya has important stakes in the National Media Group which, in turn, controls television stations which actively support the Russian government’s policies of destabilisation of Ukraine. Since the illegal annexation of Crimea, Bank Rossiya has opened branches across Crimea and Sevastopol. Bank Rossiya also provided a loan to Federal State Unitary Enterprise “Crimea Railway” and supports the construction of the railway over the Crimean bridge. Therefore, Bank Rossiya supports financially actions which undermine and threaten the territorial integrity of Ukraine.\", \"Date of assignment of state registration number: 2002-08-05\", \"OGRN: 1027800000084\", \"Numéro de licence : 328\", \"Personnes associées: Yuriy Kovalchuk (actionnaire principal) - Bank Rossiya est la banque personnelle des hauts fonctionnaires de la Fédération de Russie. En cette qualité, Bank Rossiya apporte un soutien aux décideurs russes responsables de l’annexion de la Crimée ou de la déstabilisation de l’est de l’Ukraine et tire avantage de ces décideurs. Bank Rossiya détient d’importantes participations dans le National Media Group, qui contrôle des chaînes de télévision soutenant activement les politiques du gouvernement russe visant à déstabiliser l’Ukraine. Depuis l’annexion illégale de la Crimée, Bank Rossiya a ouvert des succursales en Crimée et à Sébastopol. Bank Rossiya a également accordé un prêt à l’entreprise unitaire publique fédérale “Crimea Railway” et soutient la construction de la voie ferrée sur le pont de Crimée. Par conséquent, Bank Rossiya apporte un soutien financier à des actions qui compromettent et menacent l’intégrité territoriale de l’Ukraine. Associée à Yuriy Valentinovich Kovalchuk, actionnaire principal de Bank Rossiya.\", \"(Date of UN designation: 2022-02-23)\", \"(also AKTSIONERNY BANK RUSSIAN FEDERATION)\", \"1027800000084 (regnumber-Registration Number) (OGRN)\", \"Disqualified\"], \"phone\": [\"+78123358969\", \"+78123358500\"], \"amount\": [\"547311800\"], \"permId\": [\"4298198475\"], \"status\": [\"License code: 238, date: 2016-09-01\", \"Active\", \"норм.\", \"Код лицензии: 238, дата: 2016-09-01\"], \"topics\": [\"fin.bank\", \"debarment\", \"corp.disqual\", \"sanction\"], \"address\": [\"Pl Rastrelli, 2 Liter A, SAINT PETERSBURG, SAINT PETERSBURG, 191124, Russia\", \"RASTRELLI SQ 2 LITER A ST PETERSBURG 191124 RUSSIAN FEDERATION\", \"Pl Rastrelli 2 Liter A, St. Petersburg, Russian Federation, 191124\", \"ПЛ РАСТРЕЛЛИ Д. 2 СТР. 1, Г.САНКТ-ПЕТЕРБУРГ, 191124\", \"2 Liter A Pl. Rastrelli, Saint Petersburg, 191124\", \"Pl Rastrelli 2 Liter A Saint-Pétersbourg, 191124 RUSSIE\", \"п. Растрелли, д. 2, лит. А, Санкт-Петербург, SPE, 191124\", \"Російська Федерація, 191124, місто Санкт-Петербург, площа Растреллі, 2, літ. А\", \"Rastrelli Ploshchad\', Dom 2 Liter A, SAINT PETERSBURG, SAINT PETERSBURG, 191124, Russia\", \"м. Сімферополь, вул. Набережна імені 60-річчя СРСР, буд. 34, АР Крим, Україна\", \"2 Liter A Pl. Tastrelli, St Petersburg 191124, Russia\", \"ПЛ. РАСТРЕЛЛИ Д. 2 СТР. 1, Г.САНКТ-ПЕТЕРБУРГ, 191124\", \"RASTRELLI SQ. 2 LITER A ST. PETERSBURG 191124 ST. PETERSBURG RUSSIAN FEDERATION\", \"Pl Rastrelli 2 Liter A, Saint Petersburg, RUSSIAN FEDERATION, 191124\", \"Pl Rastrelli 2 Liter A Saint Petersburg, 191124\", \"площадь Растрелли, дом 2, корп.лит. А, Санкт-Петербург, SPE, 191124\", \"191124, Російська Федерація, м. Санкт-Петербург, пл. Растреллі, 2а\", \"191124, г. Санкт-Петербург, пл. Растрелли, д. 2, стр. 1\"