est responsable d\'actions compromettant l\'intégrité territoriale, la souveraineté et l\'indépendance de l\'Ukraine, ou la stabilité ou la sécurité en Ukraine, et soutient activement ces actions.\", \"(also  Vladimir Vladimirovich PUTIN )\", \"NOT SUBJECT TO TRAVEL RESTRICTIONS ACCORDING TO ARTICLE 29(1)\", \"Vladimir Putin is the President of the Russian Federation. On 22 Feb 2022, he signed a decree recognising the \\\"independence and sovereignty\\\" of the non-government-controlled areas of the Donetsk and Luhansk oblasts of Ukraine, and ordered the Russian armed forces into those areas. On 24 Feb 2022, he ordered a military operation in Ukraine and Russian armed forces began an attack on Ukraine. That attack is a blatant violation of the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. Vladimir Putin is responsible for and actively supporting actions undermining the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, as well as stability and security in Ukraine.\", \"The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.\", \"Function: President of the Russian Federation\"], \"title\": [\"His Excellency\"], \"gender\": [\"male\"], \"topics\": [\"corp.disqual\", \"sanction\", \"wanted\", \"export.control\", \"role.pol\", \"debarment\", \"poi\", \"role.rca\", \"role.pep\"], \"address\": [\"Moscow\", \"Bocharov Ruchey, Sochi\", \"Bocharov Ruchey Sochi Russia\", \"Novo-Ogaryevo, Moscow Region\", \"Kremlin Moscow Russia\", \"Moscow, Russia\", \"Novo-Ogaryevo Moscow Region Russia\", \"Valdai Novgorod Region Russia\", \"Kremlin, Moscow\", \"Valdai, Novgorod Region\"], \"country\": [\"ru\"], \"website\": [\"http://putin.kremlin.ru/\"], \"lastName\": [\"Putin\", \"Путин\", \"PUTIN\", \"ПУ́ТИН\", \"POUTINE\"], \"position\": [\"President of the Russian Federation\", \"chairperson\", \"président de la Fédération de Russie\", \"Supreme Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation (2012-)\", \"chairperson (2012-)\", 