an National Commercial Bank\", \"datasets\": [\"base_de_donnees_principale\"], \"last_seen\": \"2026-04-05T18:44:50\", \"referents\": [\"au-dfat-7671-russian-national-commercial-bank\", \"ru-inn-7701105460\", \"usgsa-db768d3c1d8e47ab482b33a9ef947694503f5f84\", \"ch-seco-28586\", \"ru-bik-043510607\", \"usgsa-s4mr4k4kb\", \"ofac-17755\", \"nz-ru-ban-14-russian-national-commercial-bank\", \"eu-fsf-eu-4052-33\", \"mc-freezes-f6b4660384cef0768004e1e65fa747cf26bf6384\", \"fr-ga-1856\", \"be-fod-a0d987d9fa9cbf5ba5d9cba5e67a3f1eb8854ef0\", \"gb-coh-a6rvvuwo3u2qlzemhgdl3gcxjwu\", \"usgsa-063cd62dd7164a81354c3d4cd430b816c509de9f\", \"usgsa-af795817e11053c547130f596a524a8f17ec1ff5\", \"usgsa-s4mr4k4k7\", \"bic-RNCORUMM\", \"gb-hmt-13078\", \"ua-nsdc-10047-rosijskij-nacionalnij-komercijnij-bank-publicne-akcionerne-tovaristvo\", \"lei-253400PT5760286MJW82\", \"usgsa-s4mr4k4kj\", \"permid-5085218103\", \"ca-sema-609c483de705a9f7a699f97dc79db8ac70026ed7\", \"gb-fcdo-rus0193\"], \"first_seen\": \"2022-11-17T13:39:32\", \"properties\": {\"name\": [\"Javna delniška družba „Russian National Commercial Bank“\", \"Public Joint Stock Company “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Offene Aktiengesellschaft ‚Russian National Commercial Bank‘\", \"PJSC “Russian National Commercial Bank\\\"(Société par actions cotée Banque commerciale nationale russe)\", \"Sociedade pública por ações Banco Comercial Nacional Russo\", \"RNKB OAO\", \"Kumpannija Pubblika b’Ishma Konġunti “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"viešoji akcinė bendrovė „Rusijos nacionalinis komercinis bankas“\", \"„Orosz Nemzeti Kereskedelmi Bank” Állami Részvénytársaság\", \"Société par actions cotée Banque commerciale nationale russe\", \"Banca commerciale nazionale russa\", \"Российский национальный коммерческий банк (публичное акционерное общество)\", \"ПУБЛИЧНОЕ АКЦИОНЕРНОЕ ОБЩЕСТВО\", \"Russian National Commercial Bank (Public Joint-Stock Company)\", \"Javno dioničko društvo „Ruska nacionalna komercijalna banka”\", \"Russian National Commercial Bank\", \"Veřejná akciová společnost „Russian National Commercial Bank“\", \"открытое акционерное общество «Российский Национальный Коммерческий Банк»\", \"ОАО РНКБ\", \"Viešoji akcinė bendrovė „Russian National Commercial Bank“ („Rusijos nacionalinis komercinis bankas“)\", \"Ruská národná komerčná banka\", \"PJSC \\\"Russian National Commercial Bank\\\"\", \"ROSSISKI NATSIONALNY KOMMERCHESKI BANK OTKRYTOE AKTSIONERNOE OBSHCHESTVO\", \"РОССИЙСКИЙ НАЦИОНАЛЬНЫЙ КОММЕРЧЕСКИЙ БАНК\", \"Julkinen osakeyhtiö \\\"Russian National Commercial Bank\\\"\", \"Valsts akciju sabiedrība “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Публичное акционерное общество РОССИЙСКИЙ НАЦИОНАЛЬНЫЙ КОММЕРЧЕСКИЙ БАНК\", \"Cuideachta comhstoic poiblí ‘Russian National Commercial Bank’\", \"Російський національний комерційний банк (публічне акціонерне товариство)\", \"Societatea publică pe acțiuni «Banca Națională Comercială a Rusiei»\", \"Публичное акционерное общество “Российский национальный коммерческий банк”\", \"Verejná akciová spoločnosť „Ruská národná komerčná banka“\", \"Public Joint Stock Company \\\"Russian National Commercial Bank\\\"\", \"PJSC«Banca Națională Comercială a Rusiei»\", \"Rossiyskiy Natsional\'nyi Kommercheskiy Bank PAO\", \"VAS “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Публічне акціонерне товариство Російський Національний Комерційний Банк\", \"Openbare aandelenvennootschap “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Публично акционерно дружество „Руска национална търговска банка“\", \"Banco Comercial Nacional de Rusia\", \"Відкрите акціонерне товариство «Російський Національний Комерційний Банк»\", \"Ρωσική Εθνική Εμπορική Τράπεζα\"], \"alias\": [\"Javna delniška družba „Russian National Commercial Bank“\", \"Offene Aktiengesellschaft ‚Russian National Commercial Bank‘\", \"Kumpannija Pubblika b’Ishma Konġunti “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Sociedade pública por ações Banco Comercial Nacional Russo\", \"RNKB OAO\", \"Публичное акционерное общество \\\"Российский национальный коммерческий банк\\\"\", \"RNCB\", \"viešoji akcinė bendrovė „Rusijos nacionalinis komercinis bankas“\", \"„Orosz Nemzeti Kereskedelmi Bank” Állami Részvénytársaság\", \"Société par actions cotée Banque commerciale nationale russe\", \"Banca commerciale nazionale russa\", \"Rosiiskyi natsionalnyi komertsiinyi bank (publichne aktsionerne tovarystvo)\", \"Javno dioničko društvo „Ruska nacionalna komercijalna banka”\", \"Veřejná akciová společnost „Russian National Commercial Bank“\", \"Viešoji akcinė bendrovė „Russian National Commercial Bank“ („Rusijos nacionalinis komercinis bankas“)\", \"Ruská národná komerčná banka\", \"Julkinen osakeyhtiö \\\"Russian National Commercial Bank\\\"\", \"Valsts akciju sabiedrība “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Cuideachta comhstoic poiblí ‘Russian National Commercial Bank’\", \"Societatea publică pe acțiuni «Banca Națională Comercială a Rusiei»\", \"Verejná akciová spoločnosť „Ruská národná komerčná banka“\", \"PJSC«Banca Națională Comercială a Rusiei»\", \"VAS “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Rossiski Natsionalny Kommercheski Bank Otkrytoe Aktsionernoe Obshchestvo\", \"Российский национальный коммерческий банк\", \"Openbare aandelenvennootschap “Russian National Commercial Bank”\", \"Публично акционерно дружество „Руска национална търговска банка“\", \"Banco Comercial Nacional de Rusia\", \"Ρωσική Εθνική Εμπορική Τράπεζα\"], \"email\": [\"rncb@rncb.ru\"], \"notes\": [\"(also RNKB OAO, ROSSISKI NATSIONALNY KOMMERCHESKI BANK OTKRYTOE AKTSIONERNOE OBSHCHESTVO)\", \"Après l’annexion illégale de la Crimée, la Russian National Commercial Bank (RNCB) est passée entièrement sous le contrôle de la “République de Crimée”. En janvier 2016, elle est devenue propriété de l’Agence fédérale pour la gestion des biens publics, également connue sous le nom de Rosimushchestvo [Федеральное агентство по управлению государственным имуществом (Росимущество)]. Elle est devenue le principal acteur du marché, alors qu’elle n’était pas présente en Crimée avant l’annexion. En achetant ou en reprenant des succursales de banques qui se retirent de Crimée, la RNCB a apporté un soutien matériel et financier aux actions du gouvernement russe visant à intégrer la Crimée dans la Fédération de Russie, compromettant ainsi l’intégrité territoriale de l’Ukraine. Le 29 janvier 2020, la Banque centrale russe a décidé de réorganiser la Sevastopol Marine Bank avec la participation de la RNCB. La banque a participé à deux grands projets d’infrastructures en Crimée — elle finance la construction d’un nouveau terminal aérien à Simféropol et d’installations de production (Balaklavskaya TPP et Tavricheskaya TPP). En 2023, la RNCB est devenue une filiale de la banque publique VTB Bank, la plus grande banque russe, qui est une institution financière d’importance systémique du gouvernement russe et demeure l’une des principales sources de revenus pour la Fédération de Russie. La RNCB apporte donc un soutien financier au gouvernement de la Fédération de Russie, qui est responsable de l’annexion de la Crimée et de la déstabilisation de l’Ukraine. La RNCB est également une personne morale intervenant dans des secteurs économiques constituant une source substantielle de revenus pour le gouvernement de la Fédération de Russie, qui est responsable de l’annexion de la Crimée et de la déstabilisation de l’Ukraine\", \"Previously listed under \'Ukraine criteria\' - Autonomous Sanctions (Designated Persons and Entities and Declared Persons – Ukraine) Amendment List 2014 [F2014L01184]; New listing start date 27 Aug 2023\", \"Site : http://www.rncb.ru\\nNuméro d’enregistrement: 1027700381290\", \"After the illegal annexation of Crimea, Russian National Commercial Bank (RNCB) became fully owned by the so-called “Republic of Crimea”. In January 2016, it became a property of Federal Agency for State Property Management, also known as Rosimushchestvo (Федеральное агентство по управлению государственным имуществом (Росимущество)). In 2023, it became a subsidiary of the state-owned VTB Bank\", \"Territory occupied by the Russian Federation.\\n295000, Симферополь, ул. Набережная имени 60–летия СССР, д. 34\", \"After the illegal annexation of Crimea, Russian National Commercial Bank (RNCB) became fully owned by the so-called “Republic of Crimea”. In January 2016, it became a property of the Federal Agency for State Property Management, also known as Rosimushchestvo (Федеральное агентство по управлению государственным имуществом (Росимущество)). It has become the dominant player in the market, while it had no presence in Crimea before the annexation. By buying or taking over from branches of retreating banks operating in Crimea, RNCB supported materially and financially the actions of the Russian government to integrate Crimea into the Russian Federation, thus undermining Ukraine’s territorial integrity. On 29 January 2020 The Russian Central Bank decided to reorganise the Sevastopol Marine Bank with the participation of RNCB. The bank participated in two large infrastructure projects in Crimea – it finances the construction of a new air terminal complex in Simferopol and generation facilities (Balaklavskaya TPP and Tavricheskaya TPP). In 2023, the RNCB became a subsidiary of the state-owned VTB Bank, Russia’s largest Bank, which is a systemically important financial institution of the Russian government and remains a primary source of revenue for the Russian Federation. The RNCB therefore supports financially the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine. The RNCB is also a legal person involved in economic sectors providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.\", \"(Date of UN designation: 2014-07-30)\", \"(also RUSSIAN NATIONAL COMMERCIAL BANK)\", \"Disqualified\", \"The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.\"], \"phone\": [\"+74952329000\"], \"permId\": [\"5000687775\", \"5085218103\"], \"status\": [\"INACTIVE\", \"Active\"], \"topics\": [\"fin.bank\", \"debarment\", \"corp.disqual\", \"sanction\"], \"address\": [\"295000, м. Сімферополь, вул. Набережна імені 60-річчя СРСР, буд. 34, АР Крим, Україна\", \"ul. Krasnoproletarskaya, d. 9, str. 5, MOSCOW, 127006, Russia\", \"Naberezhnaja street, 34, Simferopol, The Autonomous Republic of Crimea and the city of Sevastopol, 295000, Russia\", \"295000, Симферополь, ул. Набережная имени 60–летия СССР, д. 34\", \"УЛ НАБЕРЕЖНАЯ ИМЕНИ 60-ЛЕТИЯ СССР Д. 34, Г СИМФЕРОПОЛЬ, РЕСПУБЛИКА КРЫМ, 295000\", \"Naberezhnaja str named after 60th anniversary of USSR, 34, 295000 Simferopol\", \"Naberezhnaja Street, 34, Simferopol, The Autonomous Republic Of Crimea, The City Of Sevastopol, Ukraine, 295000\", \"улица Набережная имени 60-летия СССР, дом 34, Симферополь, 295000\", \"295000, м. Сімферополь, вул. Набережна імені 60-річчя СРСР, буд.34\", \"SIMFEROPOL, CRIMEA, Ukraine\", \"60- LETIYA USSR STR. 34 SIMFEROPOL, REPUBLIC OF CRIMEA 295000 RUSSIAN FEDERATION\", \"Naberezhnaja str named after 60th anniversary of USSR, 34, Simferopol, 295000, UKRAINE\", \"Russian Federation, 127 030 Moscow, Krasnoproletarskaya street 9/5, 295000, Simferopol, Naberezhnaja str named after 60th anniversary of USSR, 34, d. 9 korp. 5 ul.Krasnoproletarskaya, Moscow, 127030, Russian Federatio\", \"d. 9 korp. 5 ul. Krasnoproletarskaya, Moscow, 127030\", \"Naberezhnaya Imeni 60-Letiya Sssr Ulitsa, Dom 34, Simfyeropol\' Gorod, Krym Respublika, 295000, Russia\", \"127030, Російська Федерація, м. Москва, вул. Краснопролетарська, 9, будівля 5\", \"NABEREZHNAYA IMENI 60- LETIYA USSR STR 34 SIMFEROPOL 295000 SIMFEROPOL RUSSIAN FEDERATION\", \"Naberezhnaja street, 34, Simferopol, The Autonomous Republic of Crimea and the city of Sevastopol, 295000, Ukraine\", \"295000, Simferopol, Naberezhnaja str, ainsi baptisée pour commémorer le 60e anniversaire de l\'URSS, 34\", \"d. 9 korp. 5 ul.Krasnoproletarskaya, Moscow, 127030\", \"295000, Simféropol, 34 Naberezhnaja str., ainsi baptisée pour commémorer le 60e anniversaire de l’URSS.\", \"Україна, 295000, тимчасово окупована територія Автономної Республіки Крим, м. Сімферополь, вул. Набережна імені 60-річчя СРСР, буд. 34\", \"127030, Російська Федерація, м. Москва, вул. Краснопролетарська, 9 (будівля 5)\"], \"bikCode\": [\"044525607\"], \"country\": [\"ua\", \"ru\"], \"innCode\": [\"7701105460\"], \"kppCode\": [\"910201001\"], \"leiCode\": [\"253400PT5760286MJW82\"], \"website\": [\"http://www.rncb.ru/\", \"https://www.rncb.ru/\"], \"idNumber\": [\"09610705\"], \"ogrnCode\": [\"1027700381290\"], \"swiftBic\": [\"RNCORUMM\"], \"createdAt\": [\"1993-06-07\"], \"legalForm\": [\"Публичные акционерные общества\"], \"programId\": [\"NZ-RSA2022\", \"GB-RUS\", \"AU-RUSSIA\", \"CA-SEMA\", \"SECO-UKRAINE\", \"UA-SA1644\", \"US-UKRRUS-REL\", \"EU-UKR\"], \"sourceUrl\": [\"https://sanctionssearch.ofac.treas.gov/Details.aspx?id=17755\", \"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:32023R1765\", \"https://permid.org/1-5000687775\", \"https://permid.org/1-5085218103\", \"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/disqualified-officers/corporate/a6RvVuwO3u2QLzEMHgdl3GCxJwU\", \"https://gels-avoirs.dgtresor.gouv.fr/Gels/RegistreDetail?idRegistre=1856\"], \"taxNumber\": [\"7701105460\"], \"weakAlias\": [\"RNCB\"], \"modifiedAt\": [\"2025-06-26\"], \"jurisdiction\": [\"ru\"], \"addressEntity\": [\"NK-2CxEZSByHLUCPiJjqmcUFD\", \"NK-BfEN7uSz2pgaaUkMKoQLC4\", \"addr-2db4c6d60b4ee6c37b0ed91dc76ec092528923ca\"], \"uniqueEntityId\": [\"JBG1WNKSBF41\", \"E6VNRCSED5F3\", \"S43MY44L7KK8\"], \"dissolutionDate\": [\"2025-06-12\"], \"incorporationDate\": [\"1998-05-27\", \"2002-10-31\"], \"registrationNumber\": [\"1027700381290\"]}, \"last_change\": \"2026-04-05T07:58:41\", \"explanations\": {\"name_match\": {\"query\": \"Sberbank of Rus